<title>GERMANY: Siemens wins Taiwan mobile phone order.</title>
<headline>Siemens wins Taiwan mobile phone order.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>German diversified manufacturer Siemens AG said on Friday it won a mobile telephone order worth more than 350 million marks in Taiwan.</p>
<p>Under the order from Pacific Communications Services, Siemens would provide 1,200 base stations and network equipment for a cellular phone system expected to begin operating later this year.</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, +49-228 26097150</p>
